#. TRANSLATORS: The string is appended to an error message in
#. the pinentry.  The %s is the actual error message, the
#. two %d give the current and maximum number of tries.
#. Do not translate the "SETERROR" keyword.
#. TRANSLATORS: The string is appended to an error message in
